Hi Ted,

thanks for your questions.

1. Personally, different stimuli across participants should not be a problem, unless this is part of your research questions, see #2
2. I would say, the idea is not to set a prior preference toward each stimulus, instead, you could model the initial values as free parameters.
3. This is in fact from my paper, so please see the scripts here. https://github.com/lei-zhang/socialRL Let me know if you have any questions.

Hope that helps,
Lei

